Research: addResearch(2.0*workSpeed('research')*sdt*(fastlearner?1.25:1)); workAnim; when `world.research.active !== t.techAtStart` (tech completed) finish. Store t.techAtStart on begin? beginTask doesn't. Set in tick if not defined. If research active null → finish.
